{
  "adaptations": [
    "GNU source/loader/sysroot configuration separate from all existing musl recipes",
    "Direct glibc2.39 full-libc route and empty-cross-tree accommodation; no dummy libc or headers branch",
    "Core-only driver specs for glibc bootstrap module helper, no EH alias",
    "Four existing glibc fnmatch diagnostic regions extended to GCC16 -O2 false positives",
    "GNU sysroot linker-script paths rooted at sysroot to avoid double rebasing",
    "Separate GNU host and musl build compiler/archive roles; explicit GMP CC_FOR_BUILD",
    "Final GNU runtime uses POSIX threads, genuine libgcc_eh, libgcc_s and shared C++ ABI",
    "No upstream2.44 libc/6.5.6 headers, package-set import or default-base change",
    "Explicit host/build/target binutils commands; native specs generated by newly built GNU xgcc, not a tuple/PATH assumption",
    "Original GMP construction-compiler diagnostic retained in sibling evidence, installed __GMP_CC describes M/M/G role",
    "GNU Bash/binutils explicit optimization and debug stripping to eliminate construction-only header paths",
    "GNU Bash getcwd(0,0) cross premise measured by actual G executable before selecting its cache result",
    "Consumer fixtures compiled from local copies, avoiding source-file symbol metadata in runtime closures",
    "Separate C-only cancellation with no libgcc_s DT_NEEDED tests libc unwinder loading; static EH tested separately",
    "Install only the main libbacktrace helper archive and metadata; preserve raw cross-check failure separately from native observer validation"
  ],
